  "releaseNotes": "Improves formatter defaults, content negotiation, and response compression integration.\n      - Adds compact columnar encoder profile as the default for AddToon()\n      - Improves per-request encode option override handling to preserve simple values correctly\n      - Fixes TOON output formatter content negotiation to respect explicit Accept headers\n      - Fixes response compression registration to append TOON MIME types without replacing existing types\n      - Updates DevOp.Toon core runtime dependency to 0.2.7",
